# Vale, Windtalker

> Vale is a mid laner for players who want one clean fight to decide the map. He is strongest when your draft can start first and force enemies through narrow space, and he becomes a liability when the match turns into blind checking against dive.

## Snapshot

- Role: Mage
- Lane: Mid
- Specialty: Burst, Crowd Control
- Difficulty: Easy
- Tier this patch: B
- Win rate: 50.21%
- Pick rate: 0.53%
- Ban rate: 0.20%
