## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Mid Burst Pickoff (Mid)

- Items: Arcane Boots, Lightning Truncheon, Genius Wand, Holy Crystal, Divine Glaive, Blood Wings
- Core: Lightning Truncheon, Genius Wand, Holy Crystal
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Rupture, Wilderness Blessing, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Magic Boots over Arcane Boots when Use when your lane is stable and more frequent Windblow checks matter more than early flat Magic Penetration.; Winter Crown over Blood Wings when Use when one dive hero can reach you before Flicker creates enough space.; Glowing Wand over Genius Wand when Use when the enemy draft has shield or regen sustain that survives your first burst chain.
- Total cost: 12010 gold

Default ranked mid build that turns Vale's airborne setup into fast backline burst, then adds Blood Wings for safer second-position casting.

### Ultimate Reset Control (Mid)

- Items: Magic Boots, Lightning Truncheon, Fleeting Time, Holy Crystal, Divine Glaive, Blood Wings
- Core: Lightning Truncheon, Fleeting Time, Holy Crystal
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Inspire, Bargain Hunter, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Arcane Boots over Magic Boots when Use when the enemy mid lane can be punished early and penetration wins more fights than cooldown tempo.; Genius Wand over Fleeting Time when Use when your team is not reliably converting assists and guaranteed Magic Defense reduction is more valuable than reset timing.; Winter Crown over Blood Wings when Use when objective fights are decided by surviving the first assassin commit after your ultimate lands.
- Total cost: 12080 gold

Assist-driven control build for coordinated fights where Vale can cast Windstorm, collect a reset, and threaten the next choke point.

### Anti-Dive Survival (Mid)

- Items: Tough Boots, Lightning Truncheon, Winter Crown, Holy Crystal, Divine Glaive, Immortality
- Core: Lightning Truncheon, Winter Crown, Holy Crystal
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Rupture, Wilderness Blessing, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Purify
- Flex: Blood Wings over Immortality when Use when poke and chip damage threaten your setup but the enemy cannot force a late death reset.; Genius Wand over Immortality when Use when your front line can already protect you and the enemy has started stacking Magic Defense.; Magic Boots over Tough Boots when Use when the enemy dive is mobility-heavy but lacks enough crowd control to justify Fortitude and Purify together.
- Total cost: 11950 gold

Defensive mid setup for chain-control and dive drafts where Vale must live long enough to cast Windblow before the full burst chain.

